{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/roca-traquitica",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "trachytic rock",
    "es": "roca traquítica"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Leucocratic, intermediate or acid, alkaline volcanic rock belonging to the group of trachytoids, composed mainly of feldspars, of which alkali feldspar constitutes between 65 and 90%, in a microcrystalline groundmass, frequently with trachytic texture. Its plutonic equivalent is syenitic rock",
    "es": "Roca volcánica leucocrática, intermedia o ácida, alcalina, perteneciente al grupo de los traquitoides, compuesta principalmente por feldespatos, de entre los que el feldespato alcalino constituye entre el 65 y el 90%, en una matriz microcristalina, frecuentemente con textura traquítica. su equivalente plutónico es la roca sienítica"
  },
  "exactMatch": [
    {
      "id": "http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/trachyticRock"
    },
    {
      "id": "http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/trachytic_rock"
    }
  ],
